      "text": "$\\mathrm{p}\\left(\\mathrm{H}_{2}\\right)=2 \\mathrm{~atm}$ and $\\left[\\mathrm{H}^{+}\\right]=2.0 \\mathrm{M}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
